{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE BY DAY. UNCOVER SECRETS BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an intern to an isolated observatory on Mount Clearveil; Professor Elias was supposed to welcome you, but the observatory is silent\u2026 and something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological <strong>cosmic horror</strong> experience, you manage the observatory during the day and follow the traces of Professor Elias\u2019s forbidden connection with the stars at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=780 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE OBSERVATORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old devices, scattered notes, and unfinished experiments await you; as an intern, will you be able to handle the weight of this system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDLE DAILY TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect trash, grow and harvest crops, and try to keep the observatory clean and operational; yet the cursed symbols on the walls remind you that this place was never ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you cannot understand why keeping the lights on is so important\u2026 until you are left alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OBSERVATORY\u2019S SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A path that opens at night leads you beneath the basement and into the buried secrets of the observatory; to uncover them, you must be brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you are the one observing\u2026 but perhaps <strong>you are the one being observed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped.<br>Over time, you begin to lose your sense of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this observatory, or will you answer the call of the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> is an experience where calm and fear, science and madness intertwine. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702120?t=1771604352","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/a5a6088bf7c686e124d48c773547db989f832be1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771604352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/99f3bc510dfd609547cde0b6f623f1633896c58e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771604352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/99f3bc510dfd609547cde0b6f623f1633896c58e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771604352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4091760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE BY DAY. UNCOVER SECRETS BY NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned as an intern to an isolated observatory on Mount Clearveil; Professor Elias was supposed to welcome you, but the observatory is silent\u2026 and something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological <strong>cosmic horror</strong> experience, you manage the observatory during the day and follow the traces of Professor Elias\u2019s forbidden connection with the stars at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=780 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/123ab98a4da5ca214cc83a1d2f699d27.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE OBSERVATORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old devices, scattered notes, and unfinished experiments await you; as an intern, will you be able to handle the weight of this system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/e801827b4a406551252504eb45477484.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDLE DAILY TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect trash, grow and harvest crops, and try to keep the observatory clean and operational; yet the cursed symbols on the walls remind you that this place was never ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ecd0394d37ceafd9617124d64cb01fc5.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you cannot understand why keeping the lights on is so important\u2026 until you are left alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/39a9bcb3a57faae7e6b87fb83cbda78c.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE OBSERVATORY\u2019S SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A path that opens at night leads you beneath the basement and into the buried secrets of the observatory; to uncover them, you must be brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/a1c92fbcca83c8a07921fddd7b1013aa.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You think you are the one observing\u2026 but perhaps <strong>you are the one being observed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.poster.avif?t=1771604352\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.webm?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/82592a0d7ce23a399d365b314fc5a4f6.mp4?t=1771604352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped.<br>Over time, you begin to lose your sense of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this observatory, or will you answer the call of the stars?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> is an experience where calm and fear, science and madness intertwine. </p>","developers":["Immeta  Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/9f95f0447ef3e773ba19cbee3d1e6a53d46170e8/header.jpg?t=1771604352","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2025 Immeta Studios. All rights reserved.</strong><br><strong>Life & Shadow: Celestial Call </strong>and all associated logos, characters, and design elements are trademarks or registered trademarks of Immeta Studios.<br>Unauthorized reproduction or distribution of this game or any portion of it may result in civil and criminal penalties.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702120/800463634/c745bbe587bbb2e3839a31d631da1124488dcc41/1771164708/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771166737","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702120/800463634/c745bbe587bbb2e3839a31d631da1124488dcc41/1771164708/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771166737","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea