6.600x338.jpg?t=1771604352"}],"short_description":"You are trapped in the observatory of a star-obsessed professor atop Mount Clearveil. Plan your survival during the day, confront the darkness of the basement at night. Can you break the ritual and uncover the mystery?","steam_appid":3702120,"support_info":{"email":"contact@immetastudios.com","url":"https://www.immetastudios.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Norwegian, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://immetastudios.com/"}